{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_002_01_j",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:a686a6230dbc40c2197afe5bb6149008db4826e0636f986d21d5bd0b03eb8f28",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_j:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c76a252840894e7c6e2b2b4b225215512f6b5f48df7ae3cc3a5d44fca633bc58",
      "text": "唔——……你刚才，\n说要为我的梦想助一臂之力对吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_j:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f260a8025cb35763a00227f0450e8d82d12434172b3d29a50c6953f5857785aa",
      "text": "那也就是说……只要去当偶像，\n我的梦想就能实现了，可以这么理解吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_j:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d4c21b7c00743b001d85d2b0b499b2ff55a2122205732270be8f3646b45fd711",
      "text": "是的，就是这样！\n当然，本人的努力也很重要就是了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_j:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1dd1c10ac36ecdcf094acd48ebc083244972c60a622b56a142cfd9a8989e1ee0",
      "text": "面向支持自己的粉丝们，\n全力以赴地唱歌、跳舞……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_j:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1859ec297a3a17feeac44878011626cec84e2f8796c9cbbee8aad3a854b34dce",
      "text": "我相信只要看到那样的身姿，很多人\n都会绽放出笑容的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_j:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:80ebf655925834102f5b741eacb5e8097f46d96a85b4b27d82d0a9449f37b71c",
      "text": "原来如此……好，我懂了！\n感觉挺有意思的……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_j:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a2cf1403e9926d5149f97d0bf6149dff19d6fd0dd3352d303cfa84e9595a6c64",
      "text": "我要和你一起当偶像！然后，\n让大家都展露笑容！还有，接下来是～……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_j:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3207a7fb77ded1a49db40864e5f211e3e0b375a0de8106084712e23c6b7346eb",
      "text": "真的吗，非常感谢！\n那么，关于具体的日程安排……哎？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_j:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d4e047159adb4a8a05729c732e875602a5925fb295123b60e9792f56e1d23afd",
      "text": "那颗最先亮起的星……\n……呼。……呼。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_j:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dcaceefe82a5202bcf3a9c106d33e4a17ae0aeef1f0ac6de83f2a73765061ff9",
      "text": "睡着了呢。那么，\n在名片上留个便条……我就先失陪了。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
